THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===================

InstallerClean itself is licensed under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.

This file covers the third-party components redistributed inside InstallerClean's
downloads. Which of them a download carries depends on which download it is, and
the difference matters:

  InstallerClean-<version>-setup.exe     Poppins, and four Inno Setup
                                         translation files
  InstallerClean-<version>-portable.exe  Poppins
  installerclean-cli.exe                 neither, and nothing on this page
                                         applies to it: it is built from
                                         InstallerClean.Core alone, which
                                         carries no font and no wizard

The setup installs this file beside LICENSE.txt. The portable and the
command-line tool are single files with nothing to install alongside, so the
copy in the repository is the one they point at:
https://github.com/no-faff/InstallerClean/blob/main/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES


